temp/

# =====================================================
# IMPORTANT REMINDERS
# =====================================================

# NEVER commit:
# - .env files (contain Supabase keys)
# - Real patient data
# - API keys or secrets
# - Database credentials
# - SSL certificates
# - Personal health information (PHI)
# - HIPAA-regulated content

# ALWAYS verify before committing:
# - No hardcoded credentials in code
# - No real email addresses in test data
# - No production URLs in development files
# - No sensitive configuration values